<!doctype html>
<html
  {% if request.design_mode %}
    class="shopify-design-mode"
  {% endif %}
  lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}"
>
  <head>
    {%- comment -%}
      Pewman Innovation: set completo de iconos a partir del favicon del
      Customizer (Configuración → Logo y favicon). Horizon de fábrica solo
      emitía el de 32x32, con lo que iOS y Android quedaban sin icono al
      guardar el sitio en la pantalla de inicio.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if settings.favicon != blank -%}
      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 32, height: 32 }}">
      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 16, height: 16 }}">
      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 192, height: 192 }}">
      <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 180, height: 180 }}">
      <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="{{ shop.name | escape }}">
      <meta name="application-name" content="{{ shop.name | escape }}">
    {%- endif -%}
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#BD0028">

    {% comment %} This a way to wait for main content to load when navigating to a new page so that the view transitions can work consistently {% endcomment %}
    {% if settings.transition_to_main_product or settings.page_transition_enabled %}
      <link
        rel="expect"
        href="#MainContent"
        blocking="render"
        id="view-transition-render-blocker"
      >
    {% endif %}

    {%- render 'meta-tags' -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      SEO (auditoría 2026-09-07): dos URLs que Shopify crea por defecto y que
      no tienen contenido propio quedaban indexadas y competían con las
      páginas reales.
        /blogs/news            blog de fábrica, sin entradas, título en inglés.
        /collections/frontpage lista los mismos productos que el Inicio, con
                               el encabezado "Home page" de fábrica.
      Se marcan noindex (siguen navegables y no cambia nada visible). Si algún
      día se les da contenido propio, basta con sacar el handle de esta lista.
      Lo definitivo para el blog es borrarlo en Tienda online → Blogs.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign sin_indexar = false
      if blog.handle == 'news'
        assign sin_indexar = true
      endif
      if template.name == 'collection' and collection.handle == 'frontpage'
        assign sin_indexar = true
      endif
    -%}
    {%- if sin_indexar -%}
      <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow">
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Pewman Innovation: imagen social de respaldo (og:image). Home y paginas
      internas no tienen imagen propia y al compartirlas por WhatsApp/LinkedIn
      salian sin foto. Productos y articulos ya emiten la suya via meta-tags,
      por eso quedan fuera. La imagen vive en Archivos (1200x630, hero + logo
      + sello SAG/Ecocert); si se quiere cambiar, subir otra a Archivos y
      actualizar esta URL.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- unless template.name == 'product' or template.name == 'article' -%}
      <meta property="og:image" content="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0798/6348/0551/files/pewman-social-1200x630.jpg?v=1785967404">
      <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
      <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
      <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
      <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0798/6348/0551/files/pewman-social-1200x630.jpg?v=1785967404">
    {%- endunless -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      SEO (auditoría 2026-09-07): ficha de empresa para Google y para los
      sistemas de IA. Shopify ya emite un bloque Organization básico (nombre,
      logo, redes) dentro de content_for_header; este lo completa con lo que
      responde "quién es esta empresa": a qué se dedica, dónde está, cómo se
      la contacta y en qué mercados opera. Comparten el mismo @id, así que
      Google los lee como una sola entidad y se queda con el más completo.

      Los datos salen de Configuración del tema → Pewman — Contacto, así que
      si el equipo cambia el correo o la dirección, esto se actualiza solo.
      No se declara fecha de fundación porque no está confirmada.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign org_tel = settings.pewman_phone_display | default: '+56 9 9083 3908'
      assign org_mail = settings.pewman_contact_email | default: 'contacto@pewmaninnovation.com'
      assign org_legal = settings.pewman_company_legal_name | default: 'Pewman Innovation SPA'
      assign org_dir = settings.pewman_company_address | default: 'Badajoz 100, of. 708, Las Condes, Santiago'
      assign org_calle = org_dir | split: ', Las Condes' | first
    -%}
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "Organization",
        "@id": "{{ request.origin }}/#organization",
        "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
        "legalName": {{ org_legal | json }},
        "url": "{{ request.origin }}/",
        {%- if settings.logo != blank %}
        "logo": "https:{{ settings.logo | image_url: width: 500 }}",
        {%- endif %}
        "description": "Empresa chilena de biotecnología que desarrolla soluciones sustentables para aumentar la resiliencia de los cultivos frente al cambio climático, a partir de microorganismos de ecosistemas extremos como la Antártica y el Desierto de Atacama.",
        "email": {{ org_mail | json }},
        "telephone": {{ org_tel | json }},
        "address": {
          "@type": "PostalAddress",
          "streetAddress": {{ org_calle | json }},
          "addressLocality": "Las Condes",
          "addressRegion": "Región Metropolitana",
          "addressCountry": "CL"
        },
        "contactPoint": {
          "@type": "ContactPoint",
          "contactType": "sales",
          "telephone": {{ org_tel | json }},
          "email": {{ org_mail | json }},
          "areaServed": ["CL", "PE"],
          "availableLanguage": ["es"]
        },
        "areaServed": [
          { "@type": "Country", "name": "Chile" },
          { "@type": "Country", "name": "Perú" }
        ],
        "knowsAbout": [
          "Protección contra heladas",
          "Estrés hídrico en cultivos",
          "Biotecnología agrícola",
          "Microorganismos extremófilos",
          "Nanotecnología orgánica"
        ],
        "sameAs": [
          {%- assign redes = '' -%}
          {%- if settings.pewman_instagram_url != blank -%}{%- capture redes -%}{{ redes }}{{ settings.pewman_instagram_url | json }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.pewman_facebook_url != blank -%}{%- capture redes -%}{{ redes }}{% if redes != blank %},{% endif %}{{ settings.pewman_facebook_url | json }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.pewman_linkedin_url != blank -%}{%- capture redes -%}{{ redes }}{% if redes != blank %},{% endif %}{{ settings.pewman_linkedin_url | json }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.pewman_youtube_url != blank -%}{%- capture redes -%}{{ redes }}{% if redes != blank %},{% endif %}{{ settings.pewman_youtube_url | json }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if redes == blank -%}
            "https://www.instagram.com/pewmaninnovation",
            "https://www.facebook.com/pewmaninnovation",
            "https://www.linkedin.com/company/pewman-innovation",
            "https://www.youtube.com/@PewmanInnovation"
          {%- else -%}
            {{ redes }}
          {%- endif -%}
        ]
      }
    </script>

    {%- render 'stylesheets' -%}
    {%- render 'fonts' -%}
    {%- render 'scripts' -%}
    {%- render 'theme-styles-variables' -%}
    {%- render 'color-palette' -%}

    {% comment %} Pewman Innovation: estilos base + Web Components compartidos (cargar UNA sola vez) {% endcomment %}
    {{ 'pewman-base.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
    <script src="{{ 'pewman-elements.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

    {% comment %} Pewman Innovation: copia de los leads a HubSpot (los formularios siguen siendo los nativos) {% endcomment %}
    {%- render 'pewman-hubspot' -%}

    {% if request.design_mode %}
      {%- render 'theme-editor' -%}
    {% endif %}

    {{ content_for_header }}
  </head>

  <body class="page-width-{{ settings.page_width }} card-hover-effect-{{ settings.card_hover_effect }}">
    {% render 'skip-to-content-link', href: '#MainContent', text: 'accessibility.skip_to_text' %}

    {% render 'chat-drawer' %}

    <div class="page-wrapper">
      <div id="header-group">
        {% sections 'header-group' %}
      </div>

      <script>
        // Inline header height and menu style calculations to prevent layout shift
        // Note: Updates in calculateHeaderGroupHeight(), updateTransparentHeaderOffset() and setHeaderMenuStyle() utilities.js should be kept in sync with this function
        (function setHeaderHeighCustomProperties() {
          /*
           * Header calculation functions for maintaining CSS variables
           * Mimic calculateHeaderGroupHeight() in utilities.js
           */
          const header = document.querySelector('header-component');
          const headerGroup = document.querySelector('#header-group');
          const hasHeaderSection = headerGroup?.querySelector('.header-section');

          if (!header || !headerGroup) return;

          const headerTopRow = header.querySelector('.header__row--top');
          const headerHeight = header.offsetHeight;

          // Calculate the total height of the header group
          let headerGroupHeight = 0;
          const children = headerGroup.children;
          for (let i = 0; i < children.length; i++) {
            const element = children[i];
            if (element === header || !(element instanceof HTMLElement)) continue;
            headerGroupHeight += element.offsetHeight;
          }

          // Check for transparent header special case
          if (header.hasAttribute('transparent') && header.parentElement?.nextElementSibling) {
            headerGroupHeight += headerHeight;
          }

          // Set CSS variables
          document.body.style.setProperty('--header-height', `${headerHeight}px`);
          document.body.style.setProperty('--header-group-height', `${headerGroupHeight}px`);

          if (headerTopRow) {
            window.requestAnimationFrame(function () {
              document.body.style.setProperty('--top-row-height', `${headerTopRow.offsetHeight}px`);
            });
          }

          /**
           * Updates CSS custom properties for transparent header offset calculation
           * Mimic updateTransparentHeaderOffset() in utilities.js
           */

          if (!hasHeaderSection || !header?.hasAttribute('transparent')) {
            document.body.style.setProperty('--transparent-header-offset-boolean', '0');
            return;
          }

          const hasImmediateSection = hasHeaderSection.nextElementSibling?.classList.contains('shopify-section');

          const shouldApplyOffset = !hasImmediateSection ? '1' : '0';
          document.body.style.setProperty('--transparent-header-offset-boolean', shouldApplyOffset);
        })();

        (function setHeaderMenuStyle() {
          const headerComponent = document.querySelector('#header-component');
          if (headerComponent) {
            const isTouchDevice = 'ontouchstart' in window && navigator.maxTouchPoints > 0;
            const overflowList = headerComponent?.querySelector('overflow-list');
            const hasReachedMinimum = overflowList && overflowList.hasAttribute('minimum-reached');
            headerComponent.dataset.menuStyle = isTouchDevice || hasReachedMinimum ? 'drawer' : 'menu';
          }
        })();
      </script>

      <main
        id="MainContent"
        class="content-for-layout"
        role="main"
        data-page-transition-enabled="{{ settings.page_transition_enabled }}"
        data-product-transition="{{ settings.transition_to_main_product }}"
        data-template="{{ template }}"
      >
        {{ content_for_layout }}
      </main>

      <footer>
        {% sections 'footer-group' %}
      </footer>
    </div>

    {% render 'cart-drawer', render_wrapper: true %}
    {% render 'theme-drawer' %}

    {% render 'search-modal' %}

    {% if settings.quick_add or settings.mobile_quick_add %}
      {% render 'quick-add-modal' %}
    {% endif %}
  </body>
</html>
